  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobilising private investment in the Pacific: InvestPacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">InvestPacific&#xa0;is a NZ$50 million Aotearoa New Zealand-based blended finance fund for the Pacific. It will offer debt and equity to mid-size investments that generate inclusive employment, sustainable development and climate resilience. While InvestPacific is open to investments across the region, it will focus initially on agriculture, fisheries, tourism, digital economy, construction and manufacturing opportunities in the Cook Islands, Fiji, Samoa and Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
